Dear Editors of the Journal of Machine Learning Research,

I am pleased to submit my manuscript entitled
"Transforming Education and Mental Habits through Metaverse with a Scientific and Innovative Approach Using a Systematic Literature Review Method"
for consideration for publication in the Journal of Machine Learning Research (JMLR).

This paper explores the transformative role of the metaverse in education by analyzing both empirical data and a systematic review of 50 scientific studies published between 2007 and 2024. Using a mixed-method approach, the study evaluates the cognitive and motivational impact of metaverse-based learning environments and addresses technical, ethical, and psychological challenges. We believe that this research aligns with the interdisciplinary interests of JMLR readers, particularly those focused on AI applications in education and human-computer interaction.

